  <prompt>Apply Class-A rows A05, A06, A07, A08, A09, A10, A11, A12, A24 from `notes/task-202-punch-list.md` — the foundation sub-phase of task 203. Row-by-row: (a) grep-verify current repo state BEFORE applying (many rows may have landed via Wave G-8 batch 155-198+); (b) if `already-applied`, annotate row `last_known_status_after_execution: already-applied` and skip; (c) if `open`, apply per row landing-spot + effort; (d) checkpoint via context-handoff after every 3 rows completed. Foundation scope: create `provisioning-runs/` root + INDEX + `_archive/` (A05); author 8-file per-run templates in `provisioning-runs/_templates/` (A06); fill CONTENT into 9 existing `.claude/patterns/provisioning/**` skeleton files (A07 — skeletons already exist per task 202 output); author `.claude/constraints/provisioning.md` + wire into task-execute Step 4a tag map (A08); patch `/provision-environment` SKILL.md Step 1 for profile enum + environmentId intake + placeholder `sprk_dataverseenvironment` create (A09/A10/A11); fix `platform-controlplane.bicep` `jwtAudience` (A12); fix `app-service.bicep` `healthCheckPath` (A24). Amend punch list `last_known_status_after_execution` annotations per row. Do NOT commit — main session handles commit after review.</prompt>

