  <escalation>
    <trigger>If any grep-verify shows a row LANDED via Wave G-8 batch but with a partial fix (e.g. skill profile constrained to 2 of 3 enum values), STOP and escalate rather than "patching the patch" — the punch list row's `last_known_status` was authoritative at task 202 time; drift means Wave G-8 landed something the punch list missed. Reconcile via a new punch-list row rather than silent extension.</trigger>
    <trigger>If bicep dry-run (`az bicep build`) fails after A12 or A24 edits, STOP — this indicates a parameter contract drift beyond the trivial value change, and requires re-reading the module's parameter graph before proceeding.</trigger>
