  <notes>Justification (CLAUDE.md §11): Existing — task 202 authored the punch list (34 Class-A rows) + skeleton pattern files; this task consumes both. Extension — 203a is the foundation sub-phase (provisioning-runs root + template content + skill Step 1 + 2 mechanical bicep fixes) that unblocks the operator's ability to run + document a run coherently. Cost-of-doing-nothing — task 186 E2E ceremony fires without: (a) provisioning-runs project structure to organize the run in (SESSION 5 lesson); (b) constraint file that task-execute Step 4a can load for provisioning tasks; (c) working skill Step 1 that L2 accepts (L2 400s today per DS-5 c6-1/c6-2/c6-3); (d) correct `jwtAudience` (auth fails otherwise); (e) correct `healthCheckPath` (prod slot marked unhealthy). Any one of these blocks task 186's demonstration of FR-18/SC#5.

